// Section Access & performance optimization — QlikView 12 Data Architect (QV12DA)
// Goal: Secure data per user and tune memory/reload.
// Concepts: Section Access (UPPERCASE, ADMIN), Cardinality reduction, AutoNumber, Symbol tables/memory, Testing safely
// Qlik load script starter. Adapt connections/paths to your environment.

Policies:
LOAD
    PolicyID,
    Region,
    Product,
    WrittenPremium,
    IncurredLoss,
    Date(PolicyDate) as PolicyDate
FROM [lib://data/policies.qvd] (qvd);

